{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013630","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"『NAKED』……顾名思义，就是裸着。裤子倒是和JUNGLE FATIGUES一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"因为直接露着身体，防御力和迷彩率当然都很低。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，轻装上阵的好处就是移动更快。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"正如外表所见，是走肉体派路线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"AUX_PARAPHRASE_JPN_NUANCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"喂，Snake。听说你以前的代号，就是因为穿成这样到处大闹才来的。是真的吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当然是谣言。“NAKED”这个代号，是因为武器、装备、食物全都要在当地获取……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那就是说，别说光着上半身了，你是全裸着被扔进丛林的！？　而且还是从10000米高空做HALO跳伞。真不愧是传说中的Boss！！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":163,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"……你是在拿我开涮吗？　Kaz。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"看得出来？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……你就一辈子这样吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"裸着有什么不好！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"}]}